  "description": "<p>請寫一個程式，輸入一個整數 <code>N</code>，判斷它是奇數還是偶數。</p><ul><li>若是奇數，輸出 <code>Odd</code></li><li>若是偶數，輸出 <code>Even</code></li></ul><p><strong>特別注意：</strong>0 是偶數，負整數也有奇偶之分。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>第一行包含一個整數 <code>N</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>若 <code>N</code> 為奇數，輸出 <code>Odd</code>；若為偶數，輸出 <code>Even</code>。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>-10000 ≤ N ≤ 10000</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "7",
  "sampleOutput": "Odd",
  "testCases": [
    {
      "input": "7",
      "output": "Odd"
    },
    {
      "input": "4",
      "output": "Even"
    },
    {
      "input": "0",
      "output": "Even"
    },
    {
      "input": "-5",
      "output": "Odd"
    },
    {
      "input": "-8",
      "output": "Even"
    },
    {
      "input": "1",
      "output": "Odd"
    },
    {
      "input": "10000",
